# ============================================================
# AnkiAssistant - Anki card-making assistant
#   Windows desktop / Android / Windows installer
#
# Only the sources of these three apps live here. The single
# source of truth for CHANGELOG.md is the repo root.
#
# NOTE: keep this file ASCII-only (aapt2 / PowerShell 5.1 both
# choke on non-ASCII text read without an explicit encoding).
# ============================================================

# ---- build intermediates ----
build/
_selftest/
*.idsig

# ---- Windows artifacts ----
# the loose exe is only the installer's input, not a release asset
AnkiAssistant/AnkiAssistant.exe
AnkiAssistantSetup/AnkiAssistant-Setup.exe
AnkiAssistantSetup/build/
*.pdb

# ---- runtime data (holds API keys - never commit) ----
settings.ini

# ---- probes and scratch output ----
_probe/
_*.png
AnkiAssistantSetup/preview/
selftest.txt

# ---- generated (source of truth is the repo-root CHANGELOG.md) ----
AnkiAssistant/CHANGELOG.md
_release_notes.md

# ---- OS junk ----
~$*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

tools/lib/
# built-in Anki engine native libs (37 MB x2), build them yourself
# with the recipe in tools\BUILD_ENGINE.md
tools/lib/jni/
